OL,3,AMajor travel disruption and thousands
OL,4,Awithout power as Storm Austen hits UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrains are being hit by cancellations
OL,7,Fand delays in parts of the UK due to
OL,8,Fstrong winds and fallen trees - here's
OL,9,Fa rundown of the disruption
OL,11,FOne man tells us he was evacuated from
OL,12,Fa motorway service station near
OL,13,FBicester after it was hit by a power
OL,14,Fcut, while Sara Gatland in Guernsey
OL,15,Fsays her flight home to Edinburgh was
OL,16,Fcancelled due to the stormy weather
OL,18,FOn Saturday, a separate storm, named
OL,19,FBoelo, is forecast to bring more strong
OL,20,Fwinds to Scotland, Northern Ireland and
OL,21,Fnorthern England, with yellow and amber
OL,22,Fwarnings in place
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
