OL,3,AMajor travel disruption and thousands
OL,4,Awithout power as Storm Austen hits UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn parts of Scotland, rail lines will
OL,7,Fclose from 21:00 on Saturday, according
OL,8,Fto Network Rail, while people are being
OL,9,Fadvised to avoid all travel unless
OL,10,Fnecessary
